@startuml
title F1 Betting Game - Component Diagram

component "Angular SPA" as SPA
component "API Controllers\n(Auth, Bets, Races)" as API
component "Application Services\n(Betting, User, Race,\nNotification, Leaderboard)" as App
component "Domain Model\n(Entities, Enums,\nValue Objects)" as Domain
component "Infrastructure\n(Persistence, Repositories,\nUnit of Work)" as Infra
component "OpenF1 API Client" as OpenF1
database "SQL Server Database" as DB

SPA --> API : HTTP/JSON
API --> App : calls
App --> Domain : uses
App --> Infra : depends on repositories
Infra --> DB : EF Core
Infra --> OpenF1 : sync races
Infra ..> Domain : implements domain access

@enduml
